@* Apiaries are deactivated, never deleted (docs/DECISIONS.md, D-04) *@
<div class="alert alert-info d-flex align-items-start" role="note" id="deactivation-note">
    <i class="mdi mdi-information-outline me-2 font-size-18"></i>
    <div>
        <strong>@L["Apiaries are never deleted"]</strong>@L[", so that honey traceability is preserved. To take an apiary out of use,"] <strong>@L["deactivate"]</strong> @L["it from the beekeeper's apiary list: its photos and honey productions are kept, it is shown greyed out as"] <em>@L["Inactive"]</em>@L[", and it is no longer counted as active on the dashboard."] <strong>@L["Activate"]</strong> @L["restores it."]
    </div>
</div>
